&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE AfterNewRecord DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE AfterNewRecord :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    IF AVAIL RowObject THEN DO:

        ASSIGN RowObject.tipo = 1.

        RUN getProxCodModelo (OUTPUT RowObject.cod-modelo).

    END.


    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

