&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE GetProxCodModelo DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE GetProxCodModelo :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    DEFINE OUTPUT PARAMETER p-cod-modelo LIKE modelo-etiq.cod-modelo NO-UNDO.


    FOR LAST bf{&TableName} USE-INDEX ch-pr
        WHERE bf{&TableName}.cod-modelo <> 999:
    END.

    IF AVAIL bf{&TableName} THEN
        ASSIGN p-cod-modelo = bf{&TableName}.cod-modelo + 1.
    ELSE
        ASSIGN p-cod-modelo = 1.


    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

